{"parse": {"title": "13TH-18", "pageid": 139654, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/13TH-17\" title=\"13TH-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">13TH-18</span><a href=\"/wiki/13TH-19\" title=\"13TH-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">13TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">18</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.BB.91.E7.BE.8A.E7.BE.A4.E4.B9.8B.E6.AD.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"黑羊群之歌\">黑羊群之歌</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 黑羊群之歌</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Song of the Black Sheep</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>深<span class=\"color-value\"></span>渊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>凝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>望<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11318</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#6C675A\"><span style=\"font-size:127%\">距离“暴雨”落下还剩—— </span> </span>                                                            <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#6C675A\"><span style=\"font-size:127%\">距离“暴雨”落下还剩—— </span> </span>                                                            <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">歌唱家：</div><div>……普莱玛，如果你不擅长音乐，可以用这些咒语和乐团沟通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-530101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-530101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-530101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>我铭记于心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">歌唱家：</div><div>在你们去基金会玩耍的时间里，我还有很多事情要做。我想你应该能接下维系“风网”的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-640501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">歌唱家：</div><div>也许你真有机会继承你母亲的位置，但在这之前……好好表现吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_7_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_7_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_7_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>——安静！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扶住身旁粗糙的建筑外墙，勉强没有摔倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">记得曾经有多少人在你的劝诱之下戴上面具吗，不信者？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>L20,110#<span style=\"font-size:111%\">你诱骗他们，折磨他们，摧毁他们，看着他们把自己可怜的灵魂献给你所不解的神明。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……我记得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>178,104#<span style=\"font-size:111%\">现在轮到你亲自经受筛选的痛苦。比起试炼失败之后变成怪物，<br /><br />                                                                    为什么不就此投向复苏之母的怀抱？</span>                                                                                                                                                </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>31,-19#<span style=\"font-size:111%\">祂没有杀死你，证明祂愿意接纳你——母亲总是会包容孩子犯下的一两次过错。</span>    </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不，我不会回去，永远不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重新站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这张面具杀不死我，我知道如何控制它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>-259,68#<span style=\"font-size:111%\">噢……当然，这不是你第一次戴上面具，只不过眼下不会再有千万条咒语保护你的头脑。 </span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>516,-50#<span style=\"font-size:111%\">出于怎样的理由，你认为自己能再一次全身而退？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>至少现在，我还知道我在做什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头，望向最南面的一幢楼房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-314721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-314721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-314721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>那个方向是——5号楼，用来安置外来避难人员的建筑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>0,0#<span style=\"font-size:111%\">看，那些黑色的影子。那是我们的神秘学家同胞，他们戴上了面具，从此不再会感到孤独和恐惧。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰白色的高楼矗立在不远处，一支漆黑的队伍从中走出，踏上连通基金会总部的内部道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这个队列的整齐程度……是格鲁托夫的军队。普莱玛的记忆没有出错，重塑之手真的是从这里进入基金会的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>可是……为什么会是这里？这里只被划作一般收容人员的安置区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">一起去看看房子里藏着的秘密吧。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她大胆地向5号楼靠近一步，与无数阿尔卡纳的追随者擦肩而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-526201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-526201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-526201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑军官：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人在乎这个戴着面具的女人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她进入5号楼。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_29.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_29\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_29\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-3_7_bg_29.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-3_7_bg_29.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_29.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-3_7_bg_29.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_29.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有指望在这里能见到寻常的事物，但眼前的景象还是超过了她的预期——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菌丝般的物体在空气中不断颤动，仿佛是触碰到危险的捕蝇草，正向四周播散离奇的乐声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这就是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">通道——是它连接着我们所有人。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>肢体劣化为乐器的信徒们，正在用自身的器官来与“风网”发出的低沉乐声共鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑乐团：</div><div>ㄨ……ㄣ……ㄤ……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>器官劣化的信徒组成的歌唱家口中的“乐团”，正与这个怪物沟通……这是试炼失败之人的用处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>歌唱家是从什么时候开始这么做的？我过去漏掉了哪些线索才没有察觉到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她按下无用的自责感，将注意力投向那张怪异大口的深处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在“喉咙”的位置，又有一支军队影影绰绰地现出身形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">你知道该怎么做的。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>是，我知道要怎么让这个怪物闭上嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我记得怎么控制这些失去理智的信徒，也知道了普莱玛用来控制它们的咒语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我会让乐团演奏出可以关闭“风网”的乐声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">……呵。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-314719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>那么……呃——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面具猛然撕咬她的意识，覆面的双手如精巧的刑具，一层层撕破不信者的伪装。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">你难道从来没有想过，使用重塑之手的神秘术只会让面具对你的侵蚀更深？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">放弃吧。接住祂赐予你的机会。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">这是回家的机会，赎回自由的机会。<br /><br />你不再是基金会的一颗棋子，你可以带着不受束缚的心再次投向同族的怀抱。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:113%\">他们会在一间温暖的小屋中迎接你，<br /><br />那时还会有一场吟诵着轻快歌谣的宴会，<br /><br />客人们会成为你的朋友，永远赞扬你此刻的选择。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">重塑之手会赐予你想要的生活，还有一个名字，一个真正属于你的名字——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我要令伟大的群落回归渊底的冰山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咒语诵出。尖锐的嗡鸣声像一条尖牙的蠕虫——刺破眼球，钻入大脑，一路噬咬着柔软的血肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四肢的骨骼微微颤抖，她几乎能听见自己身体正在发出声音，正如那些劣化的信徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑乐团：</div><div>ㄝ——ㄥ……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在混乱嘈杂的噪音中，她听到了——乐团演奏的旋律正在转变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑乐团：</div><div>ㄚ——！ㄩ！ㄥ——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后一个音节落下的瞬间，她隐约之间听见一声来自深渊的、充满痛苦的鲸类长鸣。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/Cg-3_7_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/Cg-3_7_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/Cg-3_7_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这声鸣响被一阵如风的力量轻柔环绕着，向遥远时空的深处退去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-314721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-314721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-314721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>通道……关闭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咒语无误，她知道她成功了，但代价随之而来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>失去趋光性定律的控制，她根本没有力量抵抗面具的试炼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不……不要是……现在——不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我不想……变成怪物……不要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>好不容易才……丢下了那些名字，摆脱了……控制……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我还没有……真正地——ㄜ、活……活过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我……不、ㄨ——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>嗬——嗬——！！咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>呕——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我……还不想死……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我要……离开这里……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……我绝不会回去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_7_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_7_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_7_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这是闹哪出？我还没想过要靠这双腿上战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行女巫看着面前的飞行扫帚，已经接受自己无力回天的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她仍然弄不明白，为什么不久前红色38的神秘学引擎会哑然熄火，连同自己的神秘术也完全失效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……我只能先把你留在这里了，伙计，但愿你不要被重塑之手捡走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还好，她还有一把能够防身的手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>谁在那儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-314720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-314720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-314720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来者的模样逐渐清晰——她慢慢走近，走到足够红弩箭认清面容的距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-314713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-314713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-314713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>请……帮我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>——是你？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭接住向前摔倒的“间谍”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你身上的这些黏糊糊的东西……你去干什么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>通道……重塑之手进入基金会的通道……已经关闭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我的任务……完成。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "13TH-18"}}